== Introduction == Larger and stronger than a human, but still a mere runt compared to a true giant, the half-giant is born from the union of the two races or, more commonly, by inheriting an ancient giant lineage. Thus they are caught between both worlds with no ground to stand upon but the one they conquer for themselves, the half-giant is a natural adventurer and glory-seeker. Cloud half-giants are known to possess handsome features and a particular admiration for riches like their forefathers in their opulent sky palaces.
== Stats ==
{{Template:RaceHeader}} <onlyinclude>{{Race |NAME=Cloud Half-Giant |AWARD=800,000 |BASE=Human |ALIGNMENT= Any |ECL=+3 |STR=+2 |DEX=0 |CON=0 |INT=0 |WIS=+2 |CHA=+2 |FEATS=[[Large Stature]]</br>[[Quick To Master]]</br>[[Skilled]]</br>[[Darkvision]] |BONUS=Damage Immunity:Slashing 5%</br>Damage Immunity:Bludgeoning 5%</br>Damage Immunity:Piercing 10%</br>Damage Immunity:Electrical 10%</br>Damage Resistance: Electrical 5/- |LANGUAGE=[[Giant]] |START=Cordor</br>Skal</br>Sencliff:'''Pirate''' |OTHER=<u>Bonus Summon Stream</u></br>Air</br><u>Appareance</u></br>145% Upscaled Elf base</br><u>Bloodline</u></br>Fog</br>+2 DEX, -2 CHA, +1 ECL}}</onlyinclude> |}
