== Introduction == Larger and stronger than a human, but still a mere runt compared to a true giant, the half-giant is born from the union of the two races or, more commonly, by inheriting an ancient giant lineage. Thus they are caught between both worlds with no ground to stand upon but the one they conquer for themselves, the half-giant is a natural adventurer and glory-seeker. With boisterous ways and bravery to a fault, half-giants with fire giant blood draw attention wherever they travel, usually earning them, for good or ill, a reputation quickly.
== Stats ==
{{Template:RaceHeader}} <onlyinclude>{{Race |NAME=Fire Half-Giant |AWARD=800,000 |BASE=Human |ALIGNMENT= Any |ECL=+3 |STR=+4 |DEX=-2 |CON=+2 |INT=0 |WIS=0 |CHA=-2 |FEATS=[[Large Stature]]</br>[[Quick To Master]]</br>[[Skilled]]</br>[[Darkvision]] |BONUS=Damage Immunity:Slashing 5%</br>Damage Immunity:Bludgeoning 5%</br>Damage Immunity:Piercing 5%</br>Damage Immunity:Fire 50%</br>Damage Resistance: Fire 20/-</br>Damage Vulnerability:Cold 25% |LANGUAGE=[[Giant]] |START=Cordor</br>Skal</br>Sencliff:'''Pirate''' |OTHER=<u>Bonus Summon Stream</u></br>Fire</br><u>Appareance</u></br>165% Upscaled Dwarf base</br><u>Bloodline</u></br>Priest</br>+2 WIS, -2 STR, +1 ECL</br>Fire Praetor</br>+4 CHA, -2 STR, -2 DEX, +1 ECL}}</onlyinclude> |}
