== Introduction == Larger and stronger than a human, but still a mere runt compared to a true giant, the half-giant is born from the union of the two races or, more commonly, by inheriting an ancient giant lineage. Thus they are caught between both worlds with no ground to stand upon but the one they conquer for themselves, the half-giant is a natural adventurer and glory-seeker. By nature, frost half-giants tend to inherit the more brutish traits of their ancestry, but it does not make them any less cunning than the other half-bloods.
== Stats ==
