== Introduction == The influence of the Plane of Shadow upon these otherworldly, plane-touched creatures is usually obvious to onlookers. Gloamings are Humanoids with a pale skin that glows and shimmers faintly, and dark, furred wings. They have catlike eyes that are sensitive to bright lights, especially that of the sun above the surface. Those unfamiliar with other planes often mistake them for Tieflings, knowing that they are not strictly of their plane, but unsure on why. Their time in the harsh and unforgiving Underdark has taught them both caution and the value of friendship and camaraderie where one can find it. They have an inquisitive and curious nature and are often inflicted with a wanderlust that is perfect for any adventurer.
== Stats == {{Template:RaceHeader}} <onlyinclude>{{Race |NAME=Gloaming |AWARD=400,000 |BASE=Half-Elf |ALIGNMENT= Any |ECL=+2 |STR=-2 |DEX=+2 |CON=0 |INT=0 |WIS=-2 |CHA=+2 |FEATS=[[Small Stature]]</br>[[Sunlight Sensitivity|Minor Sunlight Sensitivity]]</br>[[Shadow Affinity]]</br>[[Immunity to Sleep]]</br>[[Hardiness vs. Illusions]]</br>[[Keen Senses]]</br>[[Low-Light Vision]]</br>[[Spell Focus: Illusion]]</br>[[Winged Character]] |BONUS=[[Greater Skill Affinity|Partial Skill Affinity: Move Silently]]</br>Damage Immunity: 20% Psychic</br>Damage Resistance: 5/- Psychic |LANGUAGE=[[Undercommon]] |START=Andunor |OTHER=<u>[[Innate Ability]]</u></br>Level 1: [[Light]]</br>Self Cast: The Gloaming starts to glow.</br>CD: 5 Minutes</br><u>Appareance</u></br>80% Downscaled Human}}</onlyinclude> |}
