== Wings ==
{| class="wikitable" |- ! Shape ! Front ! Back |- | Bat Shape (Default) | [[File:Gloaming_wings_front.png|upright|center|link=]] | [[File:Gloaming_wings_back.png|upright|center|link=]] |- | Avian Shape |[[File:Gloaming_wings_avian_front.png|upright|center|link=]] |[[File:Gloaming_wings_avian_back.png|upright|center|link=]] |- | Mothlike Shape |[[File:Gloaming_wings_moth_front.png|upright|center|link=]] |[[File:Gloaming_wings_moth_back.png|upright|center|link=]] |}
== Other details == Gloamings are planetouched beings descended from natives of Toril and the Plane of Shadow. These unusual creatures are quite uncommon in the Underdark and extremely rare in the surface world. Most observers can easily recognize that a gloaming is planetouched in some fashion, but few know exactly how. Members of other races often mistake a gloaming for some sort of tiefling. Gloamings are compulsive travelers who pride themselves on their individualism. The difficult conditions in the Underdark quickly teach them caution and the merits of working with others. While their inquisitiveness may lead them to choose the adventuring life, it does not make them completely foolish risk-takers. In a similar manner, their individuality tends to express itself in ways that do not interfere with working with other gloamings or members of other races. Gloamings are pale-skinned humanoid with catlike eyes and dark wings. Their skin is naturally luminescent, and they can control its glow, choosing a degree of illumination from none to as bright as a torch. Typical gloamings have one or more tattoos that create interesting shading effects when their skin glows.
=== Aging=== {| class="wikitable" |- ! colspan="2" style="text-align:center; vertical-align:middle; font-weight:bold;| Age ! Bonus |- | Adulthood | 18 Years | rowspan="4" style="vertical-align:middle;" | +2d100 |- | Middle Age | 100 Years |- | Old | 200 Years |- | Venerable | 300 Years |}
=== Notes===
* Despite starting in the Underdark, Gloamings, like Deep Imaskari, are not typically unwelcome on the surface. *Base race [[Elven]] language will be lost on server reset or server change. {{Race Navbox}} [[Category:Race]]

== Introduction == Larger and stronger than a human, but still a mere runt compared to a true giant, the half-giant is born from the union of the two races or, more commonly, by inheriting an ancient giant lineage. Thus they are caught between both worlds with no ground to stand upon but the one they conquer for themselves, the half-giant is a natural adventurer and glory-seeker. Descendants of stone giants may sport earthen skin and an affinity for artistic pursuits, as well as a timid demeanor
